e cheapest nonstop. There was a cheaper flight at $199, but it has one stop, so I skipped it. Reservation number is R0001.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge in New York, $189/night for 2 nights (checking in 2026-11-12 and out 2026-11-14), for $378. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night. Reservation number is R0002.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667.\n\nI booked both together with book_trip. The total is under the $1000 limit that needs manager approval. The system still sent the booking to a person, who approved it. Before booking, I checked that Dana had no existing reservations, so nothing is double-booked.", "type": "text"}]}]}